@startuml UML时序图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE6F2
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam actorBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
skinparam noteFontColor #5D4037
title 图3-6  最后一间房并发下单时序图
autonumber

actor "顾客 A" as A
actor "顾客 B" as B
participant "预订服务" as BOOK
participant "库存服务" as INV
database "MySQL 库存表" as DB
participant "支付网关" as PAY
participant "定时任务" as JOB

A -> BOOK : 提交订单（房型 X，1 间）
B -> BOOK : 提交订单（房型 X，1 间）
BOOK -> BOOK : 幂等校验（订单号 + 请求号）
BOOK -> INV : reserve(订单 A，1)
INV -> DB : UPDATE daily_inventory\nSET locked = locked + 1\nWHERE total - sold - locked >= 1
DB --> INV : 影响行数 = 1
INV --> BOOK : 预占成功
BOOK --> A : 锁房 15 分钟，跳转支付

BOOK -> INV : reserve(订单 B，1)
INV -> DB : 同条件更新
DB --> INV : 影响行数 = 0
INV --> BOOK : 无房
BOOK --> B : 提示"最后一间已售出"\n保留已填信息（REQ-051）

A -> PAY : 支付
PAY --> BOOK : 支付成功回调
BOOK -> INV : confirm(订单 A，1)
INV -> DB : sold + 1，locked - 1
BOOK --> A : 订单已确认

alt 15 分钟内未支付
  JOB -> BOOK : 扫描超时订单
  BOOK -> INV : release(订单 A，1)
  INV -> DB : locked - 1
  BOOK --> A : 订单自动取消
end

note over DB
  数据库条件更新保证只有一单成功；
  Redis 仅作热点缓存与预占加速（见组件图），
  不作为最终判定依据
end note

@enduml
